#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:5
#: 56e7b55cd3f0496c9c013da30343fa75
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:10
#: 01060714b9024663adc0aaa7801dcd5e
msgid ""
"The `Vac-U-Tug <http://www.vac-u-boat.com/Vacutug.htm>`__ is an ideal "
"candidate for a first ArduRover Boat project. It's roomy, has comprehensive"
"  build instructions targeted for inexperienced builders, and does not "
"usually require extensive waterproofing of the ArduPilot electronic "
"components. It's definitely not a speed boat, but is a great long duration "
"lake/pond cruiser."
msgstr ""
"`Vac-U-Tug <http://www.vac-u-boat.com/Vacutug.htm>`__ 是入门级 ArduRover "
"船项目的理想之选。它空间宽裕，附有针对新手的详细组装说明，通常无需对 ArduPilot "
"电子设备进行大规模防水处理。虽然它算不上快艇，但却是湖泊/池塘长时间巡航的绝佳选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:13
#: 161110a36e274b44992c2b6c66ef69f2
msgid "Parts List"
msgstr "零件清单"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:15
#: 7a75c57c6eb14033baf5b8a4427bb90c
msgid "The kit includes the drive train and requires the addition of:"
msgstr "套件包含传动系统，还需额外添加："

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:17
#: 1ac842db42c5402bb7d1551c3665d954
msgid "A standard size servo"
msgstr "标准尺寸舵机"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:18
#: cf4e2790c2944bc1b234a0db1592169d
msgid ""
"A Brushed ESC with reverse (\"1060\" style), such as `this "
"<https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_from=R40&_trksid=m570.l1313&_nkw=1060+brushed+esc&_sacat=0>`__:"
msgstr ""
"带反转功能的有刷电调（「1060」风格），例如 `此款 "
"<https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_from=R40&_trksid=m570.l1313&_nkw=1060+brushed+esc&_sacat=0>`__："

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:22
#: 92e7b32bd9cf4645a4ac1548d0575ce7
msgid ""
":ref:`Autopilot Controller<common-autopilots>`. An Omnibus F4 Pro was used "
"in this build."
msgstr ":ref:`自动驾驶控制器<common-autopilots>`。本构建中使用了 Omnibus F4 Pro。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:23
#: 8f66050246bd4a758b5c264d49e94aee
msgid ""
"GPS: Any UBLOX MN-8 class GPS with compass. BN-880 is an example, and was "
"used in this build."
msgstr "GPS：任何带罗盘的 UBLOX MN-8 级 GPS。BN-880 是一个例子，本构建中使用了该型号。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:24
#: e129e51e10a640598bc6600a9f68c107
msgid ""
"Receiver: Any 3 Channel, or more, TX/RX system. More channels allow more "
"auxiliary functions to be implemented, like automatic waypoint learning, "
"etc. Standard aircraft radios work well also."
msgstr "接收机：任何 3 通道或更多通道的遥控收发系统。通道越多，可实现的辅助功能越多，例如自动航点学习等。标准航模遥控器也可以很好地使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:25
#: e6cb621bf0a540679a57154ee1e5d610
msgid ""
"Telemetry (optional but recommended): 3DR or other telemetry radio system, "
"or via the receiver if it has that capability, like Dragonlink (bi-"
"directional) or FRSky (downlink only). Directing the boat from a cell phone "
"running a ground control station is great fun."
msgstr ""
"数传（可选但推荐）：3DR 或其他数传无线电系统，或通过具有该功能的接收机实现，例如 Dragonlink（双向）或 "
"FRSky（仅下行）。通过运行地面控制站的手机来操控船只非常有趣。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:26
#: 688a627efb8e4b948c325bd4fd477b3a
msgid ""
"Battery: A 6 cell NiMH 2000mah battery will give 1-2 hours of operation with"
" a 2-3 km/hr top speed. A 3S 3000mah LIPO battery will provide extra speed "
"and power (perhaps for rescuing disabled boats and pushing them to shore)."
msgstr ""
"电池：6 节镍氢 2000mAh 电池可提供 1-2 小时的运行时间，最高速度 2-3 km/h。3S 3000mAh "
"锂电池可提供额外的速度和动力（例如用于救援故障船只并将其推回岸边）。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:27
#: 672b0876fa7b4bf79eb89c9138e5bc4b
msgid ""
"FPV Equipment (optional): A miniature video camera and video transmitter. A "
"5.8GHz 200mw transmitter will provide more than enough range in most "
"situations. See :ref:`common-fpv-first-person-view` for more information."
msgstr ""
"FPV 设备（可选）：小型摄像头和图传发射机。5.8GHz 200mW 发射机在大多数情况下提供的距离已绰绰有余。详见 :ref:`common-"
"fpv-first-person-view`。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:30
#: cf42faf28def431f9a37ccb236459efc
msgid "Build"
msgstr "组装"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:32
#: cdd1e264f7bc430fba440108806378aa
msgid ""
"The build followed the manufacturer's instructions exactly, with a few minor"
" deviations:"
msgstr "组装严格按照制造商说明进行，仅有少量细微偏差："

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:34
#: 290681c831a7412598092f47c73c5f36
msgid ""
"Install the telemetry radio in the upper deck before gluing to lower deck"
msgstr "在将上甲板粘合到下甲板之前，先安装数传无线电"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:36
#: ed92c3749d8948039144212aa0cf53fe
msgid ""
"Waterproof the GPS, since it is located in the most likely place to get wet "
"if a wave broadsided the vessel. I 3D printed a small plastic case and "
"sealed the GPS inside, assuring a waterproof seal around it."
msgstr ""
"对 GPS 进行防水处理，因为其位置是船体被波浪侧击时最容易进水的地方。我用 3D 打印了一个小塑料外壳，将 GPS 密封其中，确保其周围的防水效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:38
#: 7eefc4399d424892852ecf25f727875a
msgid ""
"During ballasting step, in order to avoid rolling over while filling ballast"
" cups on top deck, split the operation into two or more steps: putting the "
"partial ballast in the plastic bags that will be used to mix them with epoxy"
" in a later step, and placing them inside the hull below the cups before "
"continuing to fill them with the final amounts of ballast. Keeping the "
"center of gravity low."
msgstr ""
"在压载步骤中，为避免在向上甲板的压载杯中填充压载物时发生倾覆，将操作分为两步或多步：先将部分压载物放入塑料袋（后续步骤将与环氧树脂混合），在继续填充最终压载量之前将其放入杯子下方的船体内部。保持重心低位。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:41
#: 009118c447eb4cdfb2c2809371abe692
msgid "Additional Build Steps"
msgstr "额外组装步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:43
#: da168a57340c4ad4861fb6252d291997
msgid "Mount the autopilot controller as shown below on the electronics deck."
msgstr "按下图所示将自动驾驶控制器安装在电子设备甲板上。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:45
#: 1728764e1c5e4c8097796fa35d195b48
msgid ""
"Install the camera and video transmitter as shown below. Paint and glue the "
"pilot house roof before  installing the video transmitter's antenna. After "
"confirming that the camera is oriented and functioning correctly. Waterproof"
" around its exit hole from the pilot house. Hot glue works well and can be "
"removed in the future, if needed."
msgstr ""
"按下图所示安装摄像头和图传发射机。在安装图传天线之前，先涂漆并粘合驾驶室屋顶。确认摄像头方向正确且功能正常后，对其从驾驶室穿出的孔洞进行防水处理。热熔胶效果良好，如有需要可在以后拆除。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:47
#: 238fd4b28b8d4d979262d942e6386a9a
msgid ""
"Locate the components as shown below. Separating the GPS, video transmitter,"
" and telemetry transmitter will prevent any interference between these "
"systems."
msgstr "按下图所示布置各组件。将 GPS、图传发射机和数传发射机分开放置，可防止这些系统之间相互干扰。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:59
#: 4be63380aa7d472692dd1bd476df5ac2
msgid "Setup Steps"
msgstr "设置步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:61
#: ee10f6a05eb346299a6bb4f3c01ee753
msgid "Install the firmware"
msgstr "安装固件"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:62
#: 56cb1555d8f14b1289edba122b88da8c
msgid "Set :ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 2 for boat."
msgstr "将 :ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` 设置为 2（船）。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:63
#: 50afb450fb9a44859adbfc83f6955ef2
msgid "Connect steering servo to PWM output 1 and ESC to output 3."
msgstr "将转向舵机连接到 PWM 输出 1，将电调连接到输出 3。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:64
#: a85c621f9c384978a2a23357a526c983
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATIONM<AHRS_ORIENTATION>` orientation (in this build "
"it's 6 for USB connector facing forward)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATIONM<AHRS_ORIENTATION>` 方向（本构建中，USB 接口朝前对应值为 6）"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:65
#: 4ca7d1384d3347f098a3951a7d24b598
msgid "Do Accelerometer, Compass, and RC calibrations."
msgstr "执行加速度计、罗盘和遥控校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:66
#: a4d6efd83f99476a95d61563bedc1262
msgid ""
"Set control modes. In this build, Manual, HOLD, Loiter, Steering, Acro,and "
"Auto were used."
msgstr "设置控制模式。本构建中使用了 Manual、Hold、Loiter、Steering、Acro 和 Auto。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:67
#: 69691869e9eb4a96ac78ca4225b7829b
msgid ""
"Set up throttle failsafe and low battery failsafe, if desired. Set desired "
"failsafe action."
msgstr "如需要，设置油门失控保护和低电量失控保护。设置所需的失控保护动作。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:68
#: 45f3bec2dc0243dc9aefd6f1b580aba6
msgid "Set up an auxiliary switch for Throttle Learn."
msgstr "为油门学习功能设置一个辅助开关。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:69
#: e53cf2b969e94d95acbece15e490e1ab
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`GCS_PID_MASK<GCS_PID_MASK>` = 1. For steering controller tuning in"
" the future."
msgstr "将 :ref:`GCS_PID_MASK<GCS_PID_MASK>` 设置为 1。用于将来进行转向控制器调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:70
#: 046937bf254044f5a2dbff06d70d9ccc
msgid ""
"On the bench, be sure that all modes function correctly, the steering servo "
"moves in the correct direction in ACRO mode as you change the boat's "
"heading, as well as under RC control in MANUAL."
msgstr "在台架上，确认所有模式均能正常工作：在 Acro 模式下改变船的航向时，转向舵机朝正确方向运动；在 Manual 模式下遥控操作同样正常。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:73
#: 4546e42bcd9a4a2bb0e481b918a40692
msgid "First Float"
msgstr "首次下水"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:74
#: 38952c19e7d8406d926f81c49ebec7b9
msgid ""
"Verify properly operation sailing in MANUAL mode. Trim steering from TX to "
"cruise straight. Then in the ground control station (GCS), set the steering "
"servo's :ref:`SERVO1_TRIM<SERVO1_TRIM>` to the SERVO1's output value at "
"neutral TX stick. Then set the :ref:`RC1_TRIM<RC1_TRIM>` (Assuming no RC "
"remapping has been done) to the value of the channel at neutral stick, then "
"return the trim to zero."
msgstr ""
"验证在 Manual 模式下航行是否正常。通过发射机微调转向使其直线行驶。然后在地面控制站（GCS）中，将转向舵机的 "
":ref:`SERVO1_TRIM<SERVO1_TRIM>` 设置为发射机摇杆中立时 SERVO1 的输出值。然后将 "
":ref:`RC1_TRIM<RC1_TRIM>` （假设未进行 RC 重映射）设置为摇杆中立时的通道值，再将微调归零。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:75
#: faa57abafe6948aeb1f4021b52b7ceab
msgid ""
"Next sail in ACRO. At low speed, determine the turn rate, ie how many secs "
"for a complete turn divided by 360 and enter this in the "
":ref:`ACRO_TURN_RATE<ACRO_TURN_RATE>` parameter."
msgstr ""
"接下来在 Acro 模式下航行。在低速状态下，测定转向速率，即完成一圈所需秒数除以 360，并将结果填入 "
":ref:`ACRO_TURN_RATE<ACRO_TURN_RATE>` 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:76
#: b0fc9db20fe2459e9f08fe620bde0691
msgid ""
"Next do the :ref:`rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed` and  :ref:`rover-tuning-"
"steering-rate`."
msgstr ""
"接下来执行 :ref:`rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed` 和 :ref:`rover-tuning-steering-"
"rate`。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-vacutug.rst:78
#: fd031e0dadd84ed9b0ed6b3e76cdeda2
msgid ""
"At this point, it will be tuned well enough with the defaults in the "
"navigation controller to navigate and return to home. Further :ref:`rover-"
"tuning-navigation` can be done, if desired."
msgstr ""
"此时，使用导航控制器的默认参数即可完成导航并返航。如有需要，还可以进一步执行 :ref:`rover-tuning-navigation`。"
